  (`fierz_pauli_invariant`). When `2` and two metric entries are units and `n ≥ 2`, it is the only invariant line
  (`fierz_pauli_unique`). In characteristic 2 the uniqueness fails: `k² ⟨h, h⟩` alone is invariant there
